@startuml

actor "User" as User
participant ":Search Page\n(Frontend)" as UI
participant ":PipelineStore\n(Zustand)" as Store
participant ":API Gateway\n(/classification)" as API
participant ":ProjectService" as PS
participant ":ProjectRepository" as PR
participant ":ClassificationService" as CS
participant ":JobQueueService" as JQS
participant ":classifier_training_task" as CTT
participant ":SearchService" as SS
participant ":DocumentRepository" as DR
participant ":ClassifierWrapper" as CW
participant ":Redis\n(broker + result backend)" as Redis

autonumber

== Preconditions ==
note over User, UI
  User is authenticated, a project is active,
  and a validated topic list exists in the pipeline session
  (generated, optionally edited / merged / reconciled).
end note

== Topic Selection ==

UI -> Store : Read finalised list[Topic] from pipeline state
Store --> UI : list[Topic]
UI --> User : Display topics with selection checkboxes

User -> UI : Select topics to include (>= 1)
User -> UI : Assign classifier name (mandatory, non-empty)
note over UI : "Train Classifier" disabled until >= 1 topic and a non-empty name
User -> UI : Initiate classifier training

== Dispatch ==

UI -> Store : Read project_id + selected list[Topic]
Store --> UI : project_id, list[Topic]

UI -> API : POST /classification/train\n{ project_id, name, topics }
API -> API : get_current_user (verify bearer token)
API -> PS : verify_project_owner(project_id, user_id)
PS -> PR : find_by_id(project_id)
PR --> PS : Project | None
alt project missing or not owned
    PS --> API : raise ProjectNotFound / ProjectAccessDenied
    API --> UI : 404 / 403
end

API -> CS : submit_training(topics, project_id, name)
CS -> JQS : dispatch("...classifier_training_task",\n{ topics, project_id, name })
JQS -> Redis : send_task (enqueue to broker)
JQS --> CS : job_id (AsyncResult.id)
CS --> API : job_id
API --> UI : { job_id }

UI -> Store : trainingJobId = job_id
UI --> User : Show progress (Training FastText classifier...)

== SSE Progress Stream ==

UI -> API : GET /jobs/{job_id}/stream (SSE)
API -> JQS : stream_progress(job_id)

loop Until terminal state (poll every ~1s)
    JQS -> Redis : get_status -> Celery AsyncResult.state
    Redis --> JQS : PENDING / PROGRESS
    JQS --> API : JobStatus { status, progress, result }
    API --> UI : SSE event (JobStatus JSON)
    UI --> User : Update progress indicator
end

== Background Task Execution (Celery worker) ==

Redis -> CTT : Worker picks up task
CTT -> PS : get_pending_pipeline(project_id)
PS -> PR : find_pending_pipeline(project_id)
PR --> PS : PendingPipeline | None
PS --> CTT : PendingPipeline (topic_mapping)

alt pending_pipeline is None
    CTT -> Redis : task state = FAILURE\n(ValueError: no pending pipeline)
else pending_pipeline present
    CTT -> CTT : Build training pairs: for each selected topic,\nunion doc_ids from origin_topic_ids (or own id)\n+ add OTHER_TOPIC_ID outlier docs as "Other" class

    alt no training pairs
        CTT -> Redis : task state = FAILURE\n(ValueError: empty topic mapping)
    else training data available
        CTT -> SS : get_documents_by_ids(all_doc_ids)
        SS -> DR : find_by_ids(all_doc_ids)
        DR --> SS : list[Document]
        SS --> CTT : list[Document] (full text)
        CTT -> CTT : Build parallel (texts, labels)\nfrom plain_text + topic_id labels

        alt all texts empty
            CTT -> Redis : task state = FAILURE\n(ValueError: empty texts)
        else
            CTT -> CW : train(texts, labels)
            CW --> CTT : OK
            CTT -> CW : save(file_path = {CLASSIFIER_DIR}/{uuid}.bin)
            CW --> CTT : OK
            CTT -> PS : save_classifier(project_id, ClassifierMetadata\n{ classifier_id, name, topics, file_path, created_at })
            PS -> PR : add_classifier(project_id, classifier)
            note right of PR : $push onto classifiers[]
            PR --> PS : OK
            PS --> CTT : OK
            CTT -> PS : stamp_pipeline_classifier(project_id, classifier_id)
            PS -> PR : stamp_pipeline_classifier(project_id, classifier_id)
            note right of PR
              $set pending_pipeline.classifier_id.
              pending_pipeline is NOT cleared — topic_mapping
              stays available for Phase 1 labelling.
            end note
            PR --> PS : OK
            PS --> CTT : OK
            CTT -> Redis : task result =\nClassifierMetadata
        end
    end
end

== Completion ==

JQS -> Redis : get_status -> SUCCESS + result (ClassifierMetadata)
JQS --> API : JobStatus { status: SUCCESS, result }
API --> UI : SSE event (final)
note over UI
  UI uses ClassifierMetadata from the SSE result directly;
  no follow-up GET /projects is performed.
end note
UI -> Store : setTrainedClassifier(result)
Store --> UI : Labelling step unlocked\n("Label Retrieved Documents" available; Phase 2 locked until Phase 1)
UI --> User : "Classifier trained successfully." -> proceed to labelling

== Exception – Task Fails Unexpectedly ==

CTT -> Redis : task state = FAILURE (+ error)
JQS --> API : JobStatus { status: FAILURE }
API --> UI : SSE event (final)
UI --> User : Notify: classifier training failed. Please try again.

@enduml
